Game pieces (draughts-*.svg, go-*.svg, xiangqi-*.svg, shogi-*.svg)

The draughts, Go and xiangqi pieces and the shogi tiles were drawn by Coxswain's author for
his games project and are part of Coxswain under its MIT licence (see LICENSE at the top of
the repository). They were restyled for Coxswain to sit beside the chess pieces.

The kanji on the shogi tiles are glyph outlines from Noto Sans CJK, Copyright 2014-2021 Adobe
(http://www.adobe.com/), with Reserved Font Name 'Source'; licensed under the SIL Open Font
License, Version 1.1 (tools/bom/licenses/OFL-1.1.txt). No font file is included: only the
outlines of the characters a shogi set is printed with.
